=== a range is served without materializing the file
  write big.txt "0123456789ABCDEFghijklmn"
  drain
  evict big.txt
  chunks big.txt
  fetch-range big.txt [8,16)
  chunks big.txt
  chunks big.txt published size=24 chunks=3 cached=0/3
  fetch-range big.txt [8,16) served=8 file-size=16 = "89ABCDEF"
  chunks big.txt published size=24 chunks=3 cached=1/3
