=== unsynced edits are visible to a range read
  write edit.txt "0123456789ABCDEFghijklmn"
  drain
  evict edit.txt
  write-at edit.txt @8 "XXXXXXXX"
  fetch-range edit.txt [8,16)
  chunks edit.txt
  fetch-range edit.txt [8,16) served=8 file-size=16 = "XXXXXXXX"
  chunks edit.txt staged size=24 slots=[ISI] cached=1/3
